DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       These  functions  calculate the inverse hyperbolic cosine of _x; that is
       the value whose hyperbolic cosine is _x.

RREETTUURRNN VVAALLUUEE
       On success, these functions return the inverse hyperbolic cosine of _x.

       If _x is a NaN, a NaN is returned.

       If _x is +1, +0 is returned.

       If _x is positive infinity, positive infinity is returned.

       If _x is less than 1, a domain error occurs, and the functions return  a
       NaN.

