       has occurred when calling these functions.

       The following errors can occur:

       Domain error: _x is less than 1
              _e_r_r_n_o is set  to  EEDDOOMM.   An  invalid  floating‐point  exception
              (FFEE__IINNVVAALLIIDD) is raised.

